# The speed recorder (3СЛ-2М) and the ALSN vigilance of a cab without the
# КЛУБ (the cabs with SL_SPEED1, docs/brakes-dll-replacement.md "The rest",
# 4) on the ВЛ10 (two sections, SL_SETUP 7): Brakes.dll's set against
# openRTS's step by step (--klub shadow). The clock wound (66), the needle, the
# odometer all the way; the aspects' sounds (57 a worse one: the ВЛ10 has
# no ЭПТ pressure, so no request; 106 a better one). The ЭПК key off on the
# move: 12 s with the brakes off and it vents; on again, it lets go. On the
# КЖ at about 15 km/h the periodic check: the whistle at 35 s, past 42 s
# the ЭПК vents (left alone); the ЭПК key off and on lets it go. The РБ and
# the РБС on the yellow (Switched).
#
# The ВЛ10's switches (cab053A.sd): the 395 0 (II 5, III 4, V 1), the 254 1
# (4 train, 5 buffer), the main handle 35 (0 zero), the reverser 43 (6
# forward), the ЭПК key 42, the РБ 51, the РБС 61, КБС 62 (SL_H), the ВК 63,
# АЛС 65, the clock's key 66.
#
#   openrts-train-check <RTS root> --dll mdd_vl10-127 mdd_VL10-127A mdd_VL10-127B --start on
#       --seconds 680 --script tests/data/golden/vl10_recorder.script --klub shadow
0    voltage 3000 0
0    line_limit 90
0    line_signal S1 1200 7
0    line_signal S2 2600 3
0    line_signal S3 4400 1
0    line_signal S4 5200 0
3    switch 66 1
4    switch 66 0
5    switch 1 4
6    switch 43 5
7    switch 43 6
8    switch 35 8
45   switch 35 0
# The РБ and the РБС on the yellow.
0    when 1400 press 51
0    then 10 press 61
# The ЭПК key off on the move: past 12 s it vents and the train stops; on
# again it lets go; II, off again.
0    when 2000 switch 42 0
0    then 16 expect var20 == 1
0    then 40 switch 42 1
0    then 41 expect var20 == 0
0    then 42 switch 0 6
0    then 44 switch 0 5
0    then 80 switch 35 6
0    then 110 switch 35 0
# On to the КЖ: left alone there, the check vents; the ЭПК key off and on
# lets it go.
0    when 2600 switch 35 8
0    then 60 switch 35 0
0    then 40 expect var20 == 1
0    then 50 switch 42 0
0    then 52 switch 42 1
0    then 53 expect var20 == 0
